Z||000000||FieroJoe||04-19-2001||10:24 PM||||Well, right now the whole exterior is done except for rubbing out the paint!  I even started a little bit on the inside, that'll be the next big thing to do before I can drive it again!<P>Here are some pics I took tonight after getting the rest of it done.  (btw, the flash made the marker lights look wierd)<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/leftfront_1.jpg"> <P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/rear_6.jpg"> <P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/nose.jpg"> <P>TFTS<P>------------------<BR>AIM: Snowboarder0311<BR>87 Coupe 5sp. - big resto in progress<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/profile_1.JPG"> ||||reg||1
