Z||000002||jch82||04-20-2001||12:04 AM||||Looks great! I really like that blue.<P>I really think the car is more visually appealing with the tires on.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif">  <P>So how far along are you on the interior? I have almost all of the pieces painted and the carpet is cleaned. Just got through repairing a crack in the corner of my dash and I have to spray that tomorrow. <P>Can't wait to get my fiero out! Hopefully a lot sooner than later!<P>Josh  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>------------------<BR>Yeah, my girlfriend takes collect calls from the road<BR>And it doesn't seem to matter that I'm lacking in the bulge<BR>She laughs at my dumb jokes when no one does<BR>She brings me mexican food from Sombrero's just because<BR>                 <I>-Blink 182</I>||||reg||12
