Z||000005||FieroJoe||04-20-2001||09:01 AM||||Thanks all!<P>Yes, the trunk lock is painted in blue, it stands out too much in black as I had it before, in my opinion.<P>It is also the factory color blue.<P>I am not worried about it cracking the paint off the lock cylenders or anything, because I have power trunk release and keyless entry, so I'll barely be using my door keys.<P>I start on the interior tonight, FieroMaster88 is coming over and helping a little too.  I also need to look at a Fiero that is already put together to remember how things go!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><p>[This message has been edited by FieroJoe (edited 04-20-2001).]||||reg||1
